---
description: Next.js Server/Client component boundary rules
globs: src/**/*.tsx,src/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

# Server / Client Rules

- Default to Server Components wherever possible.
- Only add `"use client"` when required.
- Do not import server-only code into client components.
- Avoid leaking large packages into client bundle.
- Ensure data fetching is colocated and optimized.
- Validate caching and ISR strategies.
- Avoid side-effects in Server Components.
- Check memorybank for past violations before generating code.
